    description: "Run LLM-driven qualitative assessment on all 7 cohorts of the revalidation session.\n\nCommands:\n  ./scripts/bakeoff-features-reflect --all\n  ./scripts/bakeoff-features-reflect aggregate --all\n\nThis produces per-repo .assessment.yaml files with developer-centric scoring (refactoring,\nnew_feature, understanding tasks) and a summary.yaml per cohort. The aggregate step\nsynthesizes cross-cohort patterns (common issues, improvement ideas, noise/overranking).\n\nThe initial run's reflect data (deep-20260301-063114/reflect/) covers all 7 cohorts but\nagainst the pre-fix codebase. This re-reflect establishes whether the fixes improved\nLLM-assessed quality. The initial run scored: C0=0U/2P/8N, C1=0U/4P/0N, C2=0U/3P/2N,\nC3=0U/4P/0N, C4=0U/6P/0N, C5=1U/4P/0N, C6=0U/5P/1N. (U=USEFUL, P=PARTIAL, N=NOT_USEFUL)"  # 1a57
